  function initRoundObserver(){var root=qs("#tailContent");if(!root||typeof MutationObserver==="undefined")return;new MutationObserver(function(){enhanceRoundView();enhanceAutoApproveNotice();enhanceSingleRejectButtons();enhanceApprovedVendorComments()}).observe(root,{childList:true,subtree:false})}
  function enhanceRoundView(){if(page!=="task-detail"&&page!=="vendor-detail")return;var root=qs("#tailContent"),t=currentTask();if(!root||!t||root.querySelector(".tail-round-board"))return;var step=root.querySelector(".tail-stepper"),rounds=t.rounds||[],active=currentRound(t),canStart=page==="vendor-detail"&&["vendor_executing","evidence_review"].indexOf(t.status)>-1&&rounds.length<3;var html='<section class="tail-round-board"><header><div><strong>72小时多轮维护</strong><span>任务仅分派和验收一次；评论撰写、审核、执行可由供应商按效果发起多轮。</span></div><em>当前第 '+(active?active.number:1)+' 轮 · 最多3轮</em></header><div class="tail-round-list">'+rounds.map(function(round){return'<article class="'+(round===active&&t.status!=="completed"?'is-active':'')+'"><b>第'+round.number+'轮</b><span>'+esc(round.status)+'</span><small>'+round.commentCount+'条评论 · '+esc(round.created)+'</small><i>'+(round.evidence&&round.evidence.length?round.evidence.length+'张佐证':'进行中')+'</i></article>'}).join("")+'</div><footer><span>维护前截图全任务共用；各轮评论处置截图持续累积；72小时截图在最后一轮完成后上传。</span>'+(canStart?'<button class="tail-button is-primary" data-tail-action="start-next-round">＋ 发起第'+(rounds.length+1)+'轮评论</button>':'')+'</footer></section>';if(step)step.insertAdjacentHTML("afterend",html);else root.insertAdjacentHTML("afterbegin",html)}
  function startNextRound(t){if(page!=="vendor-detail"){toast("新一轮由供应商根据72小时维护效果发起");return}t.rounds=t.rounds||[];if(t.rounds.length>=3){toast("当前原型最多支持3轮维护");return}var count=Math.max(1,Number(prompt("请输入本轮计划追加的评论数量",String(t.commentCount||10)))||0);if(!count)return;t.rounds.push({number:t.rounds.length+1,status:"评论撰写",commentCount:count,created:manualTimestamp(),completedAt:"",evidence:[]});t.commentCount=count;t.comments=[];t.status=t.mode==="ai"?"internal_review":"vendor_writing";if(t.mode==="ai"){var p=findPost(t.postId);for(var i=0;i<count;i++)t.comments.push(comment(generateAiComment(p,i,t.aiSettings),"pending"))}persist();render();toast("第"+t.rounds.length+"轮已启动，继续完成评论撰写与执行")}
